-- 5. one session's circuit id is worth nothing to another
ok 5.0 the second visitor got a different session
ok 5.1 the owner's circuit id is 256 bits
ok 5.2 the owner attached
ok 5.3 and was sent batch 1
ok 5.4 the thief was given a different circuit
ok 5.5 the owner's resume went out
ok 5.6 and it is replayed the very batch it already had
ok 5.7 the thief was told why

21 checks, 0 bad
ok A. ten handshakes reached the endpoint
ok B. five of them became circuits, one of which was adopted away
ok C. and adopt refused exactly one resume

